# Build context of services/avrana-home for Dockerfile.live (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Deny everything, then allow exactly the two inputs the live image copies.
*
!requirements.lock
!avrana_home/
# Never in an image, even if a rule above changes: shims, mocks, the preview gate, tests, secrets, env files.
dev/
preview/
beta/
tests/
webtests/
contracts/
secrets/
*.env
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
